<title>CANADA: Toronto market to include Bre-X in indices.</title>
<headline>Toronto market to include Bre-X in indices.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Toronto Stock Exchange said on Thursday it has decided to include Bre-X Minerals Ltd in the market's indices after all.</p>
<p>The exchange said earlier Thursday it would not add the Calgary-based gold exploration company to the indices for the time being because of continuing uncertainty surrounding the company.</p>
<p>But &quot;the TSE has received certaint additional information from Bre-X Minerals,&quot; the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said trading would resume in the stock at 1100 EST and the company will be added to the TSE 300 and the TSE 200 indices before the open on Monday, December 16.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
